---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';

const faqs = [
  ['Do you only work with healthcare clinics?', 'Yes. We work exclusively with healthcare and medical brands — IVF and fertility centres, dental clinics, aesthetic clinics, medical centres, dermatology, physiotherapy and specialist practices across the UAE and India.'],
  ['How do you actually get patients for clinics?', 'Three engines working together: local SEO so you appear when patients search, paid campaigns that reach people actively looking for treatment, and content that builds trust before the first visit. Everything points at one number — booked appointments.'],
  ['Which cities and countries do you serve?', 'We work with clinics across the UAE — Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, where we have previously worked with clinics — and in India. We know each market: the searches, the competition and the patient expectations differ emirate to emirate and city to city.'],
  ['How long until we see results?', 'Paid campaigns can bring enquiries within the first weeks. SEO and content compound over two to three months. You get a realistic timeline after the free audit — no inflated promises.'],
  ['Do you create the content and creatives?', 'Yes — strategy, design, video editing, photography direction and copy are all handled in-house. You approve the direction; we produce and publish.'],
  ['How do you report performance?', 'A clear weekly update and a monthly report: enquiries, bookings, cost per enquiry and cost per patient. No vanity metrics — if a channel is not producing patients, we say so.'],
  ['Do we need a large ad budget?', 'We work with clinics at different stages. In the free audit we will tell you honestly whether paid media makes sense at your budget — and what to do first if it does not.'],
  ['Can you work with our existing website or agency?', 'Yes. We can optimise what you have, or handle the full stack. If another agency owns part of it, we coordinate — the goal is growth, not vendor politics.'],
  ['Who will we be working with?', 'Directly with the founders. Azaan Ali Raza leads growth strategy and Areeb Ali leads marketing and creative — no account-manager telephone game.'],
];
---

<section id="faq" class="relative border-t border-[#201A14]/10 bg-[#FAF7F1] py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <SectionHeading align="center" eyebrow="FAQ" title="Straight answers." />
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-2.5">
      {faqs.map(([q, a], i) => (
        <div class="faq-item reveal rounded-2xl border border-[#201A14]/10 bg-white transition-colors hover:border-[#201A14]/20" data-open={i === 0 ? "true" : "false"} style={`--reveal-delay:${Math.min(i,6)*40}ms`}>
          <button class="faq-btn flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 sm:px-6 py-4 text-left" aria-expanded={i===0 ? "true" : "false"}>
            <span class="font-display text-[15.5px] sm:text-[17px] font-medium tracking-tight">{q}</span>
            <span class="faq-icon grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#201A14]/15 text-lg leading-none text-[#6E5334]">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-panel"><div class="faq-inner"><p class="px-5 sm:px-6 pb-5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#201A14]/60">{a}</p></div></div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
      // @ts-nocheck
  (() => {
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach((item) => {
      const btn = item.querySelector('.faq-btn');
      btn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const open = item.getAttribute('data-open') === 'true';
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach((o) => {
          o.setAttribute('data-open', 'false');
          o.querySelector('.faq-btn')?.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        });
        item.setAttribute('data-open', String(!open));
        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!open));
      });
    });
  })();
</script>
